/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (      Most research done on pediatric diabetes prediction models has focused on improving overall model accuracy, with few studies examining fairness across demographic groups. This study investigates whether pediatric diabetes prediction models differ in performance and fairness across gender, age, and race. By analyzing real world EHR data, this project aims to identify algorithmic disparities and contribute to the development of more equitable clinical prediction tools. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [22]
>>
