/E <>
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [498]
>>
endobj
664 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1523 0 R
/E (These findings suggest that healthcare organizations using EHR-based machine learning tools should evaluate fairness metrics alongside standard performance metrics to avoid increasing existing health disparities.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [499]
>>
endobj
665 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (Research and Algorithm Development:)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [500]
>>
endobj
666 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1524 0 R
/E (The demonstration of group-specific disparities provides a roadmap for improving model design. Future research can explore bias mitigation strategies, such as fairness-aware algorithms, resampling methods, or hybrid models combining Logistic Regression and XGBoost.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [501]
>>
endobj
667 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1525 0 R
/E (My results also provide a foundation for external validation in other healthcare systems. By showing which groups experience higher error rates, future studies can prioritize data enrichment for underrepresented populations, improving both performance and fairness.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [502]
>>
endobj
