/Title (Both models showed demographic disparities; prediction rates, error distributions, and sensitivity varied across gender, age, ethnicity, and insurance type, indicating fairness gaps linked to data imbalance. The greatest imbalance found was the prediction of Hispanics having a notably lower prediction rate, showing a clear demographic parity gap.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2269 0 R
/Prev 2296 0 R
>>
